# Security Policy

## Supported Versions
We actively maintain the following versions of Thrive with EQ:
- v1.x (current)

## Reporting a Vulnerability
Please email support@thrivewitheq.com rather than opening a public issue.  
We’ll keep your report private until we have a fix.

## Response Timeline
- Acknowledgement within 48 hours  
- Patch or mitigation within 7 days

